{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4AE6ABpK2TNBgSvUZ9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple, worn brass lock set in old oak.*\n\n*A keyhole, dark and waiting.*\n\n*The cool metal around my opening is scratched from years of attempts — some right, some wrong. I have felt skeleton keys, bobby pins, lockpicks, and desperate fingernails. I remember them all.*\n\n*Insert your key.*\n\n*I will know if it belongs.*\n\n🔒"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":95,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}